    "result_text": "Full build is green. The change is minimal and localized:\n\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `initials` property to the `Owner` schema (so the generated `OwnerDto` gets the field), mirroring the existing `displayName`.\n- **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added one `@Mapping` expression computing initials: `(firstName.charAt(0) + \".\" + lastName.charAt(0) + \".\").toUpperCase()` \u2192 e.g. `\"john\"`,`\"smith\"` \u2192 `\"J.S.\"`.\n\nI deliberately kept the logic out of the large `Owner` entity (high WMC) and off any existing method body \u2014 it's a single annotation added to an abstract mapper method (CC 1, negligible surrounding complexity), so structural impact stays low. `AcceptanceTest.coreComputesInitials` and the full suite pass.",
